<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>To the lost world minister Christ,</l><l>The precious One you possess,</l><l>Imparting Christ to those you love</l><l>As all their gain and success.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>To the lost world minister Christ,</l><l>The very Christ you enjoy,</l><l>Imparting Christ to all your friends</l><l>As all their boast and their joy.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>To the lost world minister Christ,</l><l>Who is your life and your all,</l><l>Imparting Christ to all you meet,</l><l>All fallen ones, great or small.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
